       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPUTE-INTEREST-EX.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PRINCIPAL PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
       01 WS-RATE      PIC 9V9999  VALUE 0.0375.
       01 WS-RESULT    PIC 9(6)V99.
       01 WS-EDITED    PIC $$$,$$9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-RESULT ROUNDED =
                   WS-PRINCIPAL * (1 + WS-RATE) ** 3.
           MOVE WS-RESULT TO WS-EDITED.
           DISPLAY "BALANCE: " WS-EDITED.
           STOP RUN.
